      "note": "Down County Council order of 1 May 1930 altering the Warrenpoint UD boundary, confirmed by the Ministry 8 Sep 1930, in force for all purposes from 1 Apr 1930."
    },
    {
      "label": "OSNI County Series six-inch (1:10,560), County Down sheet 4, Edition 5 (revised 1931)",
      "note": "Shows the county borough boundary (\"Co. Boro. Bdy.\") in a straight line from the Inner Lighthouse at the tip of the East Twin to a boundary post on the railway at Tillysburn; Edition 3 (1902) and Edition 4 (1920-21) show the same line. The pre-1958 Belfast line in the lough east of the lighthouse is traced from this sheet. Viewed in PRONI's Historical Maps Viewer (OSNI)."
    },
    {
      "label": "OSNI County Series six-inch (1:10,560), County Antrim sheet 57, Edition 5 (revised 1931)",
      "note": "Shows the county borough boundary (\"Co. Boro. Bdy.\") in a straight line from the Antrim shore south of Greencastle to the Inner Lighthouse; Editions 3 and 4 (1901-02) show the same line. The pre-1958 Belfast line in the lough west of the lighthouse is traced from this sheet. Viewed in PRONI's Historical Maps Viewer (OSNI)."
    },
    {
      "label": "Belfast Gazette, issue 1889, 6 September 1957, pp. 243-244",
      "url": "https://www.thegazette.co.uk/Belfast/issue/1889/page/243",
      "note": "S.R.&O. 1957 No. 189 (County Borough of Belfast) and No. 188 (County Down): Orders in Council under section 11 of the Boundary Survey (Ireland) Act 1854, made 29 Aug 1957, in force 1 Mar 1958, extending Belfast at Sydenham into Belfast Lough."
    },
    {
      "label": "Belfast Gazette, issue 1965, 20 February 1959, p. 66",
      "url": "https://www.thegazette.co.uk/Belfast/issue/1965/page/66",
      "note": "Notice of Orders in Council under section 11 of the Boundary Survey (Ireland) Act 1854 (Armagh, Down and the County Borough of Belfast), in force 1 Apr 1959; the Belfast order is dated 9 Feb 1959."
    },
    {
      "label": "Belfast Gazette, issue 1979, 29 May 1959, p. 185",
      "url": "https://www.thegazette.co.uk/Belfast/issue/1979/page/185",
      "note": "The Belfast Boundary Survey order of 9 Feb 1959 (in force 1 Apr 1959)."
    },
    {
